  "description": "The FatBack is the Outback reimagined with fat tires. It features the same trail-and-city versatility, full-suspension frame, and RockShox rear air shock—but equipped with 26\" x 4.0 fat tires for enhanced stability and winter readiness.\n*The FatBack's frame displays \"Outback\" branding as standard.\nPowered by a Bafang 500w (750w peak) motor and 48v 20Ah Li-ion battery (upgradeable to 25Ah), it delivers the range and performance you need. Available in Large (18.5\" frame) and smaller (16.5\" frame) sizes for riders 5'3\" and up. The wider rims accommodate fat tires while making winter tire options more accessible.\n* Contact us if you'd like to have Winter tires, Whitewall, or Street Tread tires installed.",
